<title>GERMANY: Allianz 96 EPS 9.25 dmk vs 8.72 dmk.</title>
<headline>Allianz 96 EPS 9.25 dmk vs 8.72 dmk.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>Group earnings per share (DVFA)	9.25    vs 8.72 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer is Allianz AG Holding. The company had already released profit figures for 1996 earlier in the year, when it named its EPS figure at 92 marks per share versus 87.20 marks. Allianz has since reduced the par value of its share to five marks from 50, the equivalent of a 10-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
